        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "arrangements for the use of contract employees on a temporary basis to perform bargaining unit work. The company will not enter into such arrangements for the sole purpose of reducing the size of the bargaining unit, and shares with the Union a common long-term interest in providing job stability for the workforce to the extent reasonably practicable.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                181,
