        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The company will not lay off any Bargaining Unit employees as a result of contract employees used to perform Bargaining Unit work. In the event of a layoff, all contract employees will be removed from the affected areas prior to the affected bargaining unit employee's notice of layoff.",
            "block_bbox": [
                142,
                319,
                731,
                431
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    142.0,
                    319.0
                ],
                [
                    731.0,
                    319.0
                ],
                [
                    731.0,
                    431.0
                ],
                [
                    142.0,
                    431.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The Company will provide the Union by the  $ 15^{th} $ of each month a report of the occupations where contract employees are performing Bargaining Unit work, along with the names of the contract employees utilized in each department.",
            "block_bbox": [
                143,
                440,
                731,
                534
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    142.24928283691406,
                    444.8700866699219
                ],
                [
                    729.9988403320312,
                    439.86370849609375
                ],
                [
                    730.74951171875,
                    527.9935302734375
                ],
                [
                    142.9999542236328,
                    532.9999389648438
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. No individual contract employee or series of contract employees, will be retained to perform Bargaining Unit work in a classification for longer than 90 calendar days in any facility covered by this agreement within the preceding 12 month period.",
            "block_bbox": [
                143,
                544,
                730,
                638
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    142.20867919921875,
                    544.2542114257812
                ],
                [
                    728.95947265625,
                    539.2478637695312
                ],
                [
                    729.7507934570312,
                    631.9937133789062
                ],
                [
                    143.0,
                    637.0000610351562
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The number of contract employees used will not exceed a total number 30 employees, and may not exceed 25% of the number of bargaining Unit employees in a department. This limit will not apply to contract employees used to perform custodian or relocation work.",
            "block_bbox": [
                144,
                646,
                730,
                758
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    144.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    730.0,
                    758.0
                ],
                [
                    144.0,
                    758.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. The company will not use contract employees to perform duties normally performed by Bargaining Unit job classifications that have been affected by a layoff, without first offering recall to the laid off employees. Laid off employees who are offered recall for temporary work assignments of 90 calendar days or less may decline the offer without losing their recall rights. If a junior laid off employee subsequently accepts the assignment, and the assignment eventually exceeds 90 calendar days, the junior employee may be retained without the requirement to re-offer the assignment to any more senior employee who has previously declined recall to it.",
